WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.276
This slide focuses on Think like a module Start with
the meaning of the idea

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.416
then connect it to the example and the larger
analytical workflow A module

00:00:11.442 --> 00:00:17.011
is often just a file that contains reusable
functions In the browser we can still

00:00:17.024 --> 00:00:22.800
practice the same idea by grouping related functions
Reusable helper functions

00:00:24.643 --> 00:00:29.777
Before running the example predict what the output
should look like Run it in the

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:35.040
browser inspect the result then change one input key
value or condition and run it

00:00:35.053 --> 00:00:38.264
again Focus on what changed and why
